<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Driplane Documentation on Dripline Documentation</title><link>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/</link><description>Recent content in Driplane Documentation on Dripline Documentation</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2020 14:09:21 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Installation</title><link>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/installation/</link><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2020 22:38:02 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/installation/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Configuration</title><link>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/configuration/</link><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2020 22:38:03 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/configuration/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="configuration"&gt;Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Driplane&lt;/code&gt; needs a yaml file to work. An example can be found &lt;a href="https://github.com/Matrix86/driplane/blob/master/config.yaml.example" target="_blank"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The configuration file could have several sections, but the mandatory one is the &lt;code&gt;general&lt;/code&gt; one. It specifies all the paths needed by &lt;code&gt;driplane&lt;/code&gt; to find js files, templates and rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It contains the paths of rules, templates and javascript plugins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;general&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;log_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# if nothing is specified it prints logs on stdout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;rules_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;rules&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# path containing the rules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;js_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;js&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# path of the js plugins&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;templates_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;templates&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# path of templates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# if true enable the debug logs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;update&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;enable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;false&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# if true it reloads the rules every time a file is updated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;In the configuration it is possible to define default params for &lt;em&gt;Feeders&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Filters&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/ins&gt; In this way we don&amp;rsquo;t need to specify that configuration in the rules.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Rules</title><link>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/rules/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2020 11:29:50 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/rules/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Feeders</title><link>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/feeders/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2020 11:30:07 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/feeders/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Filters</title><link>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/filters/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2020 11:30:11 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://matrix86.github.io/driplane/en/doc/filters/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>